AltoConvexCreditLineMarket::stakedCollateralAssets()
├── given the reward pool balance query succeeds
│   ├── it should query balanceOf for the market address
│   ├── when the reported balance is zero
│   │   └── it should return zero
│   └── when the reported balance is nonzero
│       └── it should return the exact reported balance
├── when the reward pool balance query reverts
│   └── it should propagate the failure
└── when the reward pool balance query returns malformed data
    └── it should revert
